=2 Walkthrough
* To start the next chapter, examine {p:Gilgamesh}'s door in {z:Norg} multiple times, then go in and talk to {p:Gilgamesh}. This will start a cutscene with {p:Gilgamesh}, {n:Aldo}, {p:Tenzen}, {n:Zeid}, {p:Kagero}, and {p:Prishe}. Once the custscene's are completed, you will see the next chapter flagged.

=2 Notes
* You will be unable to receive this cutscene if you are currently on one of the following missions:
** {M:Promathia Mission 5-2|Promathia Mission 5-2|Desires of Emptiness}: Desires of Emptiness
** {M:Promathia Mission 7-5|Promathia Mission 7-5|The Warrior's Path}: The Warrior's Path
** {M:Promathia Mission 8-1|Promathia Mission 8-1|Garden of Antiquity}: Garden of Antiquity
** {M:Promathia Mission 8-3|Promathia Mission 8-3|When Angels Fall}: When Angels Fall
** {p:Promathia Mission 8-4}: Dawn
** Possibly other {p:Tenzen}-related missions
* If you start {M:The Warrior's Path|Promathia Mission 6-4|One to be Feared}, you must finish all remaining missions up to {p:Dawn|Promathia Mission 8-4}, including the last cutscenes in {z:Lufaise Meadows}.
** This will include a Japanese midnight wait.
** This is a good opportunity to look ahead in the missions as you may be missing other expansion mission requirements if you have to wait for Japanese midnight.

